      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7000,
        "name": "「沃陆之邦」",
        "desc": "<p>纳塔的六部族之一，也称为特特奥坎。该部族的人与突角龙共同生活。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/34cbc5aa060896e731bea85173816bed_7493845042385634080.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "万杰鲁是来自沃陆之邦的战士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7299,
        "name": "玛薇卡",
        "desc": "纳塔的领袖，继承「基扬戈兹」之古名，誓以圣火为战争国度照亮未来。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/12/30/2f098b1f15854fd9dafc54998795a59e_864981592196815761.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "万杰鲁和玛薇卡是好友，也经常比试武艺，在玛薇卡成为执政官之前，她还输给了这位战士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7490,
        "name": "特诺切",
        "desc": "<p>生活在五百年前的纳塔英雄。因为被放逐的原因，他并不属于任何部族。在对抗深渊的战争期间，他召集齐了六大部落盟友，并前往了西部岛屿与一只黑色巨型怪物战斗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/24/326985891/5037534a2e3fdae2e4478820ca23e24b_3049923554289824640.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "万杰鲁在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间加入特诺切，一同对抗深渊。\n<color=#efeff0>卡乌克</color>\n一只突角龙，万杰鲁的伙伴。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7502,
        "name": "伊安珊",
        "desc": "沃陆之邦健身俱乐部的总教练，闻名纳塔的营养师。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/25/dd9a200a86b792fb1b73ef1ee7de0911_2097378734184941134.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "参与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7472,
        "name": "赫布里穆",
        "desc": "<p>据说，赫布里穆是纳塔的所有人类执政官共同拥有的名字。现任执政官为玛薇卡。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/25/326985891/d5506157004bc0381b4b390f00f69070_868667769925710086.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的计划、纳塔六位英雄之一。她继承了古名「乌威佐」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>相关物品</color>"
